	(text "Current Limit: 4.452A\n\nSlew Rate (SR) = 18 V/20 ms = 0.9 V/ms\nC_{DVDT} pF = 2000 mA/(0.9 V/ms) = 2200 pF\nI_{IN RUSH} mA = 0.9 V/ms * C_{34} = 216 mA\nPD_{IN RUSH} W = (18 V * 0.216 mA)/2 = 1.98 W\n\nV_{PG} = V_{PGTH(R)} * (R18 + R17)/R17 -> 15.4V = 1.2 * (47,000 + R17)/R17 - > R17 = 3.972K"
